<title>SWAZILAND: SOCCER-COSAFA CASTLE CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COSAFA CASTLE CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MBABANE 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mozambique beat Swaziland 4-0</p>
<p>(half-time 2-0) in the first round of the Cosafa Castle Cup at</p>
<p>the Somholo stadium on Sunday:</p>
<p>Scorers: Adelino (36th min, 42nd, 70th), Eurico (83rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000</p>
<p>Add cosafa Castle Cup first round</p>
<p>In Maseru:</p>
<p>Lesotho 0 Zambia 2 (halftime 0-2)</p>
<p>Scorers: Edward Kangwa (10th), Mwape Miti (15th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
